# Images lourdes — gitignorées, disponibles via GitHub Actions artifacts
# output/uploads/base/        : uploads upscalés ~15 MB chacun → workflow upscale_uploads
# output/colorways/           : colorways HSV ~10-30 MB → workflow colorize
# output/uploads/colorways/   : colorways uploads → workflow colorize
# output/upscaled/            : images upscalées
# output/thumbnails/ est inclus dans git (vignettes JPEG ~50-100 KB, navigables GitHub)
